---
title: SecureCapita - Login & Multi-Factor Authentication Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant NG as Angular LoginComponent
    participant API as UserController (/user)
    participant SVC as UserService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant MAIL as SMTP / SMS

    U->>NG: Enter email + password
    NG->>API: POST /user/login
    API->>SVC: authenticate(email, password)
    SVC->>DB: load user + roles
    SVC->>DB: record LOGIN_ATTEMPT event

    alt MFA disabled (using_mfa = 0)
        SVC-->>API: user authenticated
        API->>SVC: create access + refresh JWT
        SVC->>DB: record LOGIN_ATTEMPT_SUCCESS
        API-->>NG: 200 OK + accessToken + refreshToken (user data)
        NG->>NG: Store tokens (localStorage)
        NG-->>U: Redirect to dashboard (/)
    else MFA enabled (using_mfa = 1)
        SVC->>DB: save twofactorverifications (code + expiry)
        SVC->>MAIL: send 2FA code
        API-->>NG: 200 OK (MFA required, no tokens)
        NG-->>U: Prompt for verification code
        U->>NG: Enter code
        NG->>API: GET /user/verify/code/{email}/{code}
        API->>SVC: verify code not expired
        SVC->>DB: validate + delete code
        API->>SVC: create access + refresh JWT
        SVC->>DB: record LOGIN_ATTEMPT_SUCCESS
        API-->>NG: 200 OK + accessToken + refreshToken
        NG-->>U: Redirect to dashboard (/)
    end
